jobs.description:
In this position, you will be responsible for assembling, connecting, and maintaining industrial electrical systems. You will work with power distribution systems, cable routes, control panels, and industrial machinery. Together with your team, you ensure that installations operate safely and efficiently.

Your tasks include:

- Installing and connecting industrial electrical equipment;
- Reading electrical diagrams and technical documentation;
- Troubleshooting and repairing electrical malfunctions;
- Inspecting installations and carrying out maintenance work;
- Working together with colleagues and supervisors on-site.

- Completed MBO education in Electrical Engineering;
- Experience in industrial electrical work;
- VCA certificate or willingness to obtain it;
- Knowledge of NEN 1010 and NEN 3140 is a plus;
- Independent and accurate working attitude;
- Dutch or English speaking.
